      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to caramelize.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced chicken breast and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, cumin, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the shredded Gouda cheese until it is melted and the sauce is silky.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro, on a Talavera plate."
  ],
